From 0f6109b4afa0f2452b844dc991d8e81563239f3a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 3 Aug 2026 22:29:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] CUDA/HIP: fold the attention-gate softplus into the
 multiply that consumes it

Gated attention multiplies the attention result by softplus(g_proj), a per-head
gate that broadcasts over the head dimension. Upstream already has a fused
unary+mul path, but it requires the two multiply operands to have the SAME
shape, so it declines this pair and the softplus stays its own kernel launch -
one per layer per token, over n_head values.

Its only consumer is the multiply immediately after it, and that multiply
already runs as the folded-quantize kernel added in patch 0011 (mul + q8_1 in
one launch). This reads the softplus input there instead and evaluates the
softplus per element, removing the separate launch.

Bit-identical to the unary + k_mul_bcast0_quant pair it replaces:

- softplus is elementwise and both tensors are contiguous over the same
  elements in the same order, so flat index i1 selects the same element in the
  input as in the softplus output the multiply would have read;
- the value used is ggml_cuda_softplus_f32(g), which is the expression the
  stock unary kernel stores (unary.cu's op_softplus now calls it, so the two
  cannot drift);
- the product is still src0 * gate in that order, and the quantize epilogue,
  the cache registration and every downstream consumer are untouched.

The fold is refused unless the multiply is exactly the broadcast-over-dim0
shape the folded-quantize kernel already handles, only view/no-op nodes sit
between the softplus and the multiply, the multiply consumes the softplus
result directly or through a plain reshape of it, and nothing else in the graph
reads either tensor (so not writing the softplus output is unobservable).

On Laguna-XS-2.1-Q4_K_M (RDNA4, gfx1201) this removes 40 kernel launches per
decoded token and improves decode throughput by ~0.45 percent at byte-identical
output (all four fixture completions identical over 128 greedy tokens).

GGML_CUDA_DISABLE_SOFTPLUS_MUL=1 disables the fold.
